---
title: "hyp, the acts on one finding"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: no finding
  s1: not folded
  s2: declined
  s3: folded
  s4: refuted
  s5: ended
  s6: settled
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an agent adds the finding
  s1 --> s2: the owner declines it
  s1 --> s3: the owner adds a Goal that names it
  s1 --> s4: an agent refutes it
  s3 --> s5: the owner closes the Goal
  s3 --> s6: the owner lands the Goal with a select
  s3 --> s4: an agent refutes it
  s5 --> s3: the owner adds a Goal that names it
  s5 --> s4: an agent refutes it
  s6 --> s3: the owner adds a Goal that names it
  s6 --> s4: an agent refutes it
